      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Hi @{64c874d96cd8a464921efa26|full_name}, could you share some screenshots of your Body Tracking and Calibration & Debug settings in the Main Menu? I've been able to replicate some broken behavior when using legacy modes on my naturally very short (0.1m-0.21m) avatars as well as naturally taller, scaled-down avatars that will need to be fixed, but have been unable to replicate the issue on non-legacy. There's clearly some issues here, but I'd like to confirm your specific configuration as a test case as well as verify whether or not one or both of these toggles is active for you. Thanks.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
